* Sequential and counter cores (project-authored, simplified): XSPICE d_dff / d_jkff / d_dlatch and gates between bench_din and
* bench_dout stages (io.lib). Parameters: see gates.lib. SA/RA: 1 when the set / reset pin is active low.
* A pin that is active low and unconnected reads inactive (pulled to vc); other unconnected pins read low.
